    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "UCW. Analysis of Child Economic Activity and School Attendance Statistics from National Household or Child Labor Surveys . February 5, 2013. Reliable statistical data on the worst forms of child labor are especially difficult to collect given the often hidden or illegal nature of the worst forms. As a result, statistics on children’s work in general are reported in this chart, which may or may not include the"
